{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p025:m0330","start":330,"end":333,"surface":"庾頤之","kind":"person","person_id":"z0q_t4c_p88","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p025","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan"},{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p032:m0174","start":174,"end":177,"surface":"庾頤之","kind":"person","person_id":"z0q_t4c_p88","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p032","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-099-huanxuan:p025","text":"裕率義軍至竹裏，玄移還上宮，百僚步從，召侍官皆入止省中。赦揚、豫、徐、兗、青、冀六州，加桓謙征討都督、假節，以殷仲文代桓脩，遣頓丘太守吳甫之、右衛將軍皇甫敷北距義軍。裕等於江乘與戰，臨陣斬甫之，進至羅落橋，與敷戰，復梟其首。玄聞之大懼，乃召諸道術人推算數為厭勝之法，乃問眾曰：「朕其敗乎？」曹靖之對曰：「神怒人怨，臣實懼焉。」玄曰：「人或可怨，神何為怒？」對曰：「移晉宗廟，飄泊失所，大楚之祭，不及于祖，此其所以怒也。」玄曰：「卿何不諫？」對曰：「輦上諸君子皆以為堯舜之世，臣何敢言！」玄愈忿懼，使桓謙、何澹之屯東陵，卞範之屯覆舟山西，眾合二萬，以距義軍。裕至蔣山，使羸弱貫油帔登山，分張旗幟，數道並前。玄偵侯還云：「裕軍四塞，不知多少。」玄益憂惶，遣武衛將軍庾頤之配以精卒，副援諸軍。于時東北風急，義軍放火，煙塵張天，鼓噪之音震駭京邑。劉裕執鉞麾而進，謙等諸軍一時奔潰。玄率親信數千人聲言赴戰，遂將其子升、兄子浚出南掖門，西至石頭，使殷仲文具船，相與南奔。","source_position":{"kind":"wikitext_codepoint_positions","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisourc